Credits and attribution
=======================

ai-seo-toolkit is original code written for this repository. It was inspired
by, and takes ideas (not code) from, these MIT-licensed projects:

- geo-optimizer-skill by Juan Camilo Auriti (Auriti-Labs)
  https://github.com/Auriti-Labs/geo-optimizer-skill
  The concept of scoring a website for AI answer engines (GEO/AEO).
  Not affiliated with or endorsed by that project; we do not use the
  names "GeoReady" or "GEO Optimizer" for this project, per its
  TRADEMARKS.md policy.

- mcp-gsc by Amin Foroutan
  https://github.com/AminForou/mcp-gsc
  The approach of exposing Google Search Console through a simple,
  agent-friendly interface with a cached OAuth token.

- OpenSEO by Ben Senescu (every-app)
  https://github.com/every-app/open-seo
  The idea of keyword research and SEO workflows built for both humans
  and AI agents. OpenSEO uses the paid DataForSEO API; this toolkit's
  keyword research uses only free suggestion data instead.

All three projects are MIT licensed. Thank you to their authors.
